---
layout: layouts/base.njk
lang: ja
section: series
title: シリーズ
description: 暁 Akatsuki の公開シリーズを順番に読む。
permalink: /ja/series/
---
<section class="series-page" aria-labelledby="series-title">
  <h1 id="series-title">{{ title }}</h1>
  <p>{{ description }}</p>
  {% for seriesKey, series in site.series %}
    {% set posts = collections.publishedPostsJa | seriesPosts(series.id) %}
    {% if series.title[lang] and posts.length %}
    <section class="series-group" aria-labelledby="series-{{ series.id }}">
      <h2 id="series-{{ series.id }}">{{ series.title[lang] }}</h2>
      <p>{{ series.description[lang] }}</p>
      <p>{{ posts.length }} {{ site.i18n[lang].stories }}</p>
      <p><a href="{{ posts[0].url }}">{{ site.i18n[lang].recommendedStart }}: {{ posts[0].data.displayTitle }}</a></p>
      <h3>{{ site.i18n[lang].readingOrder }}</h3>
      <ol class="series-list">
        {% for post in posts %}
        <li class="series-row"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.displayTitle }}</a><p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </section>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</section>
